  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/qRogT5Gy/fd489ce5ed2aa2de6b346b55d11787c9b5ab2fdf.png\" alt=\"CobbleGen\" width=\"150\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center;font-weight:bold\">CobbleGen</h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">一款 Minecraft 模組，可讓您自訂或隨機化鵝卵石（玄武岩與石頭）生成器。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblegen/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=2020709689:7499\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/v3/assets/cozy/supported/fabric_vector.svg\" alt=\"支援 Fabric\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblegen/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=2020709689:7498\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/v3/assets/cozy/supported/forge_vector.svg\" alt=\"支援 Forge\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblegen/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=2020709689:10150\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/null2264/devins-badges-null/master/cozy_vector.svg\" alt=\"支援 NeoForge\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Minecraft 1.20.2 以上版本已不再支援 Forge，建議您考慮遷移至 NeoForge。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">別相信 CurseForge 糟糕的側邊欄推薦，請前往&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcobblegen\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> 或（舊版）CurseForge 的&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblegen/files/all\" rel=\"nofollow\">所有檔案</a> 頁面取得正確版本的模組！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">欲了解更多資訊，請至&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcobblegen\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> 查看該模組！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fziro2264\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"width:100%\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/d86de987-e6b5-4596-a760-bfa2ed525064.webp\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/sP9xRy6\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/v3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/discord-singular_vector.svg\" width=\"36\"></a></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblegen/files/all\" width=\"100%\" height=\"480\"></iframe></span></span></p>",
